'''Kuudra''' is a {{boss}} found in the {{Zone|Kuudra's Hollow}}, accessed from the {{Zone|Forgotten Skull}}. {{Item|Kuudra Key}}s are used to unlock Reward Chests unlocked after the fight.

== Tiers ==
There are {{Green|5}} tiers of the Kuudra boss fight: '''Basic''', '''Hot''', '''Burning''', '''Fiery''', and '''Infernal'''. Each of them have differing [[Faction]] [[Reputation]] requirements and mob wave spawn timings.

