== Loot ==
Each tier of '''Kuudra''' has its own loot pool that its Reward Chests roll from. There will be a free chest, which rewards {{Item|Crimson Essence}}, and a paid chest: depending on the tier selected, you will need its respective {{Item|Kuudra Key}} (e.g. an {{Item|Infernal Kuudra Key}} is required to unlock the paid chest in Kuudra Infernal Tier).

You are guaranteed to obtain {{Item|Crimson Essence}}, {{Item|Kuudra Teeth}}, an [[Attributes|Attribute Shard]], or an {{Item|Enchanted Book}}, as well as an extra piece of gear. Having the {{Item|Kuudra Teeth Plaque}} maxed out at {{Special}} grants a small chance to obtain a {{Item|Kuudra Mandible}}.

{{/Loot}}

== Collection ==
'''Kuudra''' also has a [[Collections|Boss Collection]]. Defeating '''Kuudra''' will increment progress towards the '''Kuudra Collections''', which primarily rewards the {{Item|Kuudra Pet}} and [[File:Kuudra Chunk.png|21px|link=Kuudra Chunk]] [[Kuudra Chunk]] upgrades, as well as {{Item|Crimson Essence}} and {{Item|Kuudra Teeth}}. The amount of progress is directly related to the tier completed; for example, a Basic tier will only grant 1 point, while an Infernal tier will grant 5 points.

{{/Collection UI}}

